<li>Test how willing customers are to set their own substitution rules before building the logic</li>
<li>Start the availability data work, since every other improvement depends on it</li>
</ul>
<div class="serif copy"><p><em>Results will be added as testing progresses.</em></p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
